	UpgradeDescription(0)="Unlocks the <font color=\"#00CCFF\">Void Reserves</font> weapon upgrade in the trader for all your weapons. Void Reserves increases both <font color=\"#6B0099\">magazine capacity</font> and <font color=\"#6B0099\">spare ammo</font>."
